</element-citation></ref></ref-list><ack id="ack0010"><sec id="sec5"><title>Authors&#x02019; Contributions</title><p id="p0070">Jerry H. Rose: Writing (original draft, review &#x00026; editing). Michael J. Sikorski: Writing (review &#x00026; editing). Patrick W. Ruane: Data acquisition, Writing (review &#x00026; editing). Dania Hudhud: Data acquisition, Writing (review &#x00026; editing). Abdulhameed M. Al-Sabban: Conceptualization, Supervision, Writing (review &#x00026; editing).</p></sec></ack><fn-group><fn id="d36e90"><p id="ntpara0010"><bold>Conflicts of Interest:</bold> The authors disclose no conflicts.</p></fn><fn id="d36e94"><p id="ntpara0015"><bold>Funding:</bold> The authors report no funding.</p></fn><fn id="d36e98"><p id="ntpara0020"><bold>Reporting Guidelines:</bold> CARE Case Report Guidelines.</p></fn><fn id="d36e102"><p id="ntpara0025"><bold>Ethical Considerations:</bold> Informed patient consent was obtained for case publication.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>